Output ordering within the result JSON (serde_json::Map preserves insertion order):
1. `changed_files`, `changed_symbols`, `affected_files`, `affected_symbols`, `affected_total` (context)
2. `risk_score`, `risk_breakdown` (summary)
3. `constraint_violations`, `resolved_constraint_violations`, `waived_constraint_violations` (constraints)
4. `convention_violations`, `convention_matches`, `waived_violations`, `drift_alerts` (conventions)
5. `health_findings` (new — on-demand biomarker findings)
6. `hrr_shape_changes` (existing — shape changes)
7. `health_delta` (new — per-file score deltas with attribution)
8. `recommended_reads`, `behavioral_coupling` (navigation)

